"<b>How the grades are reckoned.</b> Coin grades your treasury, generosity and betting; Glory your fame and win rate; Honor your personality minus every poach and broken contract; Spectacle your showmanship and fame; Training your discipline and how many fighters you have improved; Arena time how crowded your stable is. Home depends on each fighter's city.":"<b>How the grades are reckoned.</b> Coin grades your treasury, generosity and betting; Glory your fame and win rate; Honour your personality minus every poach and broken contract; Spectacle your showmanship and fame; Training your discipline and how many fighters you have improved; Arena time how crowded your stable is. Home depends on each fighter's city.",
