"<b>Raising your grades</b>: treasury and low greed raise Coin; wins and fame raise Glory and Spectacle; Discipline plus improved fighters raises Training; a small roster raises Arena time; and Honor is the slow one — poaches (−9) and broken pledges (−6) scar it, kept pledges (+3) heal it.":"<b>Raising your grades</b>: treasury and low greed raise Coin; wins and fame raise Glory and Spectacle; Discipline plus improved fighters raises Training; a small roster raises Arena time; and Honour is the slow one — poaches (−9) and broken pledges (−6) scar it, kept pledges (+3) heal it.",
"<b>Rating fits armor and fills the purse.</b> Before the bout a fighter gets +1 AP for every 6 points above 62 (65 → +1, 74 → +2, 80 → +3, 86+ → +4-5) and +1 coin for every 5 points above 70 (75 → +1, 90 → +4). A 37 walks out bare with an empty purse; a 65 with one extra AP; an 85 with four AP, three coin and the Hard brain.":"<b>Rating fits armour and fills the purse.</b> Before the bout a fighter gets +1 AP for every 6 points above 62 (65 → +1, 74 → +2, 80 → +3, 86+ → +4-5) and +1 coin for every 5 points above 70 (75 → +1, 90 → +4). A 37 walks out bare with an empty purse; a 65 with one extra AP; an 85 with four AP, three coin and the Hard brain.",
