"<b>The Road of Flavius</b> starts at Arles and ends at Roma. Commit a well-armored, high-HP gladiator from your Ludus: one loss ends it, so the survivable classes (Soldier, Veteranus) walk further than glass cannons.":"<b>The Road of Flavius</b> starts at Arles and ends at Roma. Commit a well-armoured, high-HP gladiator from your Ludus: one loss ends it, so the survivable classes (Soldier, Veteranus) walk further than glass cannons.",
"<b>The tools</b>: Pitch (1h, aimed at a motive you grade well), Send a gift (2h, lands hardest on coin-hungry fighters), Host a feast (4h, the big swing), Scout (3h, sparring report + motives), and the <b>Pledge</b> — promise the main event within 2 weeks for +12 interest at the table. Keep it and the barracks notice; break it and your Honor pays for years.":"<b>The tools</b>: Pitch (1h, aimed at a motive you grade well), Send a gift (2h, lands hardest on coin-hungry fighters), Host a feast (4h, the big swing), Scout (3h, sparring report + motives), and the <b>Pledge</b> — promise the main event within 2 weeks for +12 interest at the table. Keep it and the barracks notice; break it and your Honour pays for years.",
