"Each week's games are in one city — and in that week you can walk its <b>city square</b>: the temple, the <b>stalls</b> that sell weapons, armor and offerings into your Armory, the auction — and <b>Walk the Sand</b> at the arena gate. Explore it in your own career. Not in this lesson.":"Each week's games are in one city — and in that week you can walk its <b>city square</b>: the temple, the <b>stalls</b> that sell weapons, armour and offerings into your Armoury, the auction — and <b>Walk the Sand</b> at the arena gate. Explore it in your own career. Not in this lesson.",
"Every fighter weighs three <b>motives</b> (coin, glory, honor, spectacle, training, home, arena time) and grades your ludus A–F on each. Interest ≈ the weighted sum. <b>Scout first</b>: it reveals their motives, so your pitches stop guessing.":"Every fighter weighs three <b>motives</b> (coin, glory, honour, spectacle, training, home, arena time) and grades your ludus A–F on each. Interest ≈ the weighted sum. <b>Scout first</b>: it reveals their motives, so your pitches stop guessing.",
