"New in v0.21 (part 1): custom creations join the league only when you <b>add them to the rolls</b> — and the fallen stay fallen · <b>⏩ Sim to end</b> at any moment of an event, even while fighting it yourself · a redesigned <b>Match Week</b> card (purse, appearance fee, summa rudis, ratings, fame) · the <b>Acta Diurna</b> leads with the week's biggest story by the numbers, recaps the empire, lets you ☆ favorite living gladiators and strikes out the dead and freed in old editions · the Ludus tab gathers training, schooling, promotion, ledger and the Fallen · ⚕ injury badges and healing right from the roster · 🏵 fame marks · richer obituaries · rivalries between old stables · four new stables and five new lanista presets · take over a ludus under your own name · a gentler default league (rookie mercy, \"arena time\") · × close buttons everywhere · English calendar dates and a Season tab · many alignment and window fixes.":"New in v0.21 (part 1): custom creations join the league only when you <b>add them to the rolls</b> — and the fallen stay fallen · <b>⏩ Sim to end</b> at any moment of an event, even while fighting it yourself · a redesigned <b>Match Week</b> card (purse, appearance fee, summa rudis, ratings, fame) · the <b>Acta Diurna</b> leads with the week's biggest story by the numbers, recaps the empire, lets you ☆ favourite living gladiators and strikes out the dead and freed in old editions · the Ludus tab gathers training, schooling, promotion, ledger and the Fallen · ⚕ injury badges and healing right from the roster · 🏵 fame marks · richer obituaries · rivalries between old stables · four new stables and five new lanista presets · take over a ludus under your own name · a gentler default league (rookie mercy, \"arena time\") · × close buttons everywhere · English calendar dates and a Season tab · many alignment and window fixes.",
"New in v0.31: the Gear forge (custom weapons with printed-bounds stats and their own cards, custom armor), the drawn armor set from the designer's own scans (with a legacy toggle), house flags everywhere (picker, Flag press, the stands superfan), one unified spectator system (full figures in the city, faces in the tiers), textured city shops, spectator dealings limited to three a week, loans sized to fame and record, house rules locked at creation.":"New in v0.31: the Gear forge (custom weapons with printed-bounds stats and their own cards, custom armour), the drawn armour set from the designer's own scans (with a legacy toggle), house flags everywhere (picker, Flag press, the stands superfan), one unified spectator system (full figures in the city, faces in the tiers), textured city shops, spectator dealings limited to three a week, loans sized to fame and record, house rules locked at creation.",
"New in v0.34: the rebranded main menu with the group photo, the Sutler’s Stall market, the crew sweeping up leftovers and emptying the stands, the Debtor’s Gambit, the one-file share build, honors gated by legacy, Shut down the ludus, Easy/Standard/Hard house rules.":"New in v0.34: the rebranded main menu with the group photo, the Sutler’s Stall market, the crew sweeping up leftovers and emptying the stands, the Debtor’s Gambit, the one-file share build, honours gated by legacy, Shut down the ludus, Easy/Standard/Hard house rules.",
"New in v0.39: one sculptor (drag, bake and unbake) in the Token, Weapon, Armor, Trophy and Banner designers, blank canvases with a Start-from picker, a weapon-first forge with its card below, and armor fitted on the avatar and worn in play.":"New in v0.39: one sculptor (drag, bake and unbake) in the Token, Weapon, Armour, Trophy and Banner designers, blank canvases with a Start-from picker, a weapon-first forge with its card below, and armour fitted on the avatar and worn in play.",
"New in v0.6–0.7: spectator tastes, tempers and moods with emotes (up to 48 in the stands, one section per class color); the bookmaker's wagers, banked in your active lanista's treasury; the Creator Studio (custom characters, beasts and events, name generator); Manager mode with bankruptcy, weekly repairs and generated rivals; the roguelike Ludus (saved gladiators update automatically after every event they fight in — the fallen are struck for good).":"New in v0.6–0.7: spectator tastes, tempers and moods with emotes (up to 48 in the stands, one section per class colour); the bookmaker's wagers, banked in your active lanista's treasury; the Creator Studio (custom characters, beasts and events, name generator); Manager mode with bankruptcy, weekly repairs and generated rivals; the roguelike Ludus (saved gladiators update automatically after every event they fight in — the fallen are struck for good).",
"New in v0.8: shields absorb by choice; freedom (the rudis) for 50+ CF winners, memorialized among the Liberti; a persistent crowd of regulars with memories, faces and allegiance colors; match-day omens swaying attendance, purses and hometown fighters; Flavius himself reacting above the A-1 corner; a deeper Creator Studio (named skin tones, ability values, beast templates); career leaderboard and one-click lanistae at the bookmaker's table.":"New in v0.8: shields absorb by choice; freedom (the rudis) for 50+ CF winners, memorialized among the Liberti; a persistent crowd of regulars with memories, faces and allegiance colours; match-day omens swaying attendance, purses and hometown fighters; Flavius himself reacting above the A-1 corner; a deeper Creator Studio (named skin tones, ability values, beast templates); career leaderboard and one-click lanistae at the bookmaker's table.",
