"Run a ludus as its <b>lanista</b>. Recruit fighters the way college coaches recruit: every fighter has an <b>interest</b> level in every ludus, driven by what they want (coin, glory, honor, spectacle, training, home, arena time) and by how your personality and record grade on each. Scout them with sparring bouts simulated in the Ludus, enter them on match nights, bet on the bouts, and poach stars from rival stables. Every bout is a real Flavius Rule event: simulate it instantly or watch it live on the board. And mind the books — three week-ends in the red, or a season ended in debt, and the creditors close the ludus <b>for good</b>.":"Run a ludus as its <b>lanista</b>. Recruit fighters the way college coaches recruit: every fighter has an <b>interest</b> level in every ludus, driven by what they want (coin, glory, honour, spectacle, training, home, arena time) and by how your personality and record grade on each. Scout them with sparring bouts simulated in the Ludus, enter them on match nights, bet on the bouts, and poach stars from rival stables. Every bout is a real Flavius Rule event: simulate it instantly or watch it live on the board. And mind the books — three week-ends in the red, or a season ended in debt, and the creditors close the ludus <b>for good</b>.",
